    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/922e1dd43a5c0c85d0eb355ae14867bb.avif?t=1709531788\" width=616 height=168 /></span><br><br><strong>Bam Boom Blade</strong> is a physics-based 2D joust game for 2 players. Players will act as a wuxia riding on a bamboo, and try to defeat your rival using only 2 joysticks on your gamepad.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMPLE AND INTUITIVE</strong></h2>Use left joystick to <strong>Bend</strong> bamboo, and use right joystick to <strong>Wave</strong> sword. It's just that easy. You and your friends can learn as soon as you hold your gamepad.<br><br>The control and mechanics are simple, but winning is not. Take full control of your body, sword, and manage the bamboo.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bamboo</strong></h2><strong>Left Joystick</strong> is for Body and Bamboo. Push your joystick alongside the bamboo to climb up/down, or push towards other angles to bend the bamboo.<br><br>Build your momentum to one-hit kill. Climb down to the bottom and have a close combat. Intentionally get injured and free your leg to move wildly. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/23e46d959e831b94ade9b53be16b78be.poster.avif?t=1709531788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/23e46d959e831b94ade9b53be16b78be.webm?t=1709531788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/23e46d959e831b94ade9b53be16b78be.mp4?t=1709531788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Blade</strong></h2><strong>Right Joystick</strong> is for Blade. When you hit, it makes a difference to hit different body part. Your Blade can parry rival's blade. <br><br>Parry rival's sword and do a counter attack. Attack your rival's flailing limbs with a precise slash! Or simply wait your rival to dash into your sword.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/94fc78051f01adb8563bc1855539f826.poster.avif?t=1709531788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/94fc78051f01adb8563bc1855539f826.webm?t=1709531788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709800/extras/94fc78051f01adb8563bc1855539f826.mp4?t=1709531788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
